		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Baran and Kota &lt;/strong&gt;are the &lt;strong&gt;major soybean-producing districts&lt;/strong&gt; in Rajasthan.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Jhalawar, Chittorgarh, Bundi, Sawai Madhopur, Ajmer, Dausa, etc. are the major producing districts.&lt;/li&gt;
