	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rajasthan&lt;/strong&gt; is the &lt;strong&gt;third largest soybean-producing state&lt;/strong&gt; after Madhya Pradesh and Maharashtra.​&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabi, Kharif, and Zayed &lt;/strong&gt;crops are mainly grown in Rajasthan.
	&lt;ul&gt;
