		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wheat, mustard, linseed&lt;/strong&gt;, sugarcane, potato, peas, and opium are the &lt;strong&gt;major crops of Ravi.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

