&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mukhyamantri Paryatan Udyog&amp;nbsp;Sambal Yojana&lt;/span&gt; -&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;On the occasion of &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;World Tourism Day&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;#39;, the Rajasthan government announced this scheme for the development of tourism in the state.&lt;/li&gt;
