&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;​&lt;/strong&gt;Under this scheme, tourism entrepreneurs will get special benefits, due to which a&lt;strong&gt; 1% additional interest subsidy &lt;/strong&gt;will be given to them for &lt;strong&gt;3 years&lt;/strong&gt; on the&lt;strong&gt; interest of loans up to 25 lakhs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
