		&lt;li&gt;The main functions of the Rajasthan Seva Sangh are to listen to the common man&amp;#39;s problems, ban the begar pratha, boycott foreign goods,&amp;nbsp;and promote khadi goods.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

