	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rajavallabha&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Mandan writes it.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;It provides information about the 15th-century military organization, architecture, and Mewar.&lt;/li&gt;
