		&lt;li&gt;It is located near the border of the state of Punjab and also the international border of the nation of Pakistan.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;It is often referred to as &amp;ldquo;the food basket of Rajasthan&amp;rdquo; due to its fertile plains similar to those one would find in Punjab.&lt;/li&gt;
