		&lt;li&gt;Jalore was originally called Jabalipur in honour of the saint Maharishi Jabali.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Jodhpur&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
