&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/01/F2_Madhuri_State%20Govt._25.01.2023_D38.png&quot; style=&quot;width: 385px; height: 212px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Here, Doctor is the &amp;#39;paternal uncle&amp;#39; of Mahesh.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Hence, the correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Paternal Uncle&lt;/span&gt;&amp;quot;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

